[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888390173","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106515#issuecomment-2888390173","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106515","id":2888390173,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sKVYd","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-17T13:21:30Z","updated_at":"2025-05-17T13:21:30Z","body":"Looks like the issue comes from here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/34f005d810e8967ee0d57afb78f8e0a64f473094/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/storage_rd/texture_storage.cpp#L2329\n\nThis logic determines the format of the new rd_texture. If we use SRGB, it still creates a non-srgb texture, but with an sRGB view. But it seems on your device, that isn't a supported combination. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888390173/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888765820","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106515#issuecomment-2888765820","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106515","id":2888765820,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sLxF8","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-18T04:44:39Z","updated_at":"2025-05-19T02:15:46Z","body":"I find the issue can be fixed by:\n```gdscript\n    format.add_shareable_format(RenderingDevice.DATA_FORMAT_R8G8B8A8_SRGB)\n    format.add_shareable_format(RenderingDevice.DATA_FORMAT_R8G8B8A8_UNORM)\n```\nIn fact, the shareable formats are also added when creating rd texture internally in `texture_2d_initialze`. So, this is not a bug.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888765820/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]